WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:11.990
<b>"Fortune favors the bold."</b>

00:05.790 --> 00:11.990
Virgil, "Aeneid"

00:13.280 --> 00:16.370
Quit spreading these 
shitty rumors, Hashimoto!

00:16.370 --> 00:20.790
We know you're the one spreading 
this crap on Sakayanagi's orders.

00:20.790 --> 00:22.880
Please, stop it, Ibuki-san.

00:23.090 --> 00:24.880
You stay out of this!

00:24.880 --> 00:27.670
We're not gonna let this stand, man.

00:28.130 --> 00:30.130
You really want to do this?

00:30.130 --> 00:31.320
Hey, don't!

00:31.320 --> 00:32.530
Stop it!

00:32.530 --> 00:34.510
You back off! It's none of your business!

00:34.510 --> 00:37.830
Ayanokoji got rumors spread about him, too.

00:37.830 --> 00:39.110
It <i>is</i> our business.

00:39.110 --> 00:42.400
A little crush on Karuizawa's 
barely anything, though.

00:43.220 --> 00:45.650
I-It is not!

00:45.970 --> 00:48.500
I don't like to say this,

00:48.900 --> 00:52.240
but I suspect you, as well, Hashimoto.

00:52.240 --> 00:53.660
Yeah, I'll bet.

00:53.660 --> 00:57.540
I'm the only witness to your secret 
meet-up with Karuizawa, after all.

00:57.540 --> 00:59.040
Meet-up?!

00:59.040 --> 01:01.290
It was nothing serious.

01:02.040 --> 01:04.540
Don't ignore us, you bastard!

01:04.540 --> 01:06.800
Ishizaki-kun, please don't fight!

01:06.800 --> 01:08.380
But...

01:08.380 --> 01:10.390
Even if you get him to confess,

01:10.390 --> 01:13.050
Sakayanagi-san will never admit to it.

01:13.050 --> 01:14.930
So we're just supposed 
to lie down and take it?!

01:16.240 --> 01:19.410
Could I ask you to forgive them for today?

01:19.810 --> 01:23.280
Nothing to forgive. 
There's no real harm done.

01:24.030 --> 01:28.320
But I'd appreciate it if you'd 
stop suspecting us for no reason.

01:28.790 --> 01:31.490
We don't need baseless 
accusations in our lives.

01:32.420 --> 01:33.560
Understood.

01:34.710 --> 01:35.950
Let's go.

01:49.090 --> 01:53.340
Ichinose-san finally came to school, did she?

01:53.570 --> 01:56.600
Just in time for finals.

01:56.600 --> 01:58.580
What's our next move?

02:04.290 --> 02:05.350
Okay.

02:05.930 --> 02:07.350
You all did great.

02:09.180 --> 02:12.720
You got a 90, Kiyo-pon? That's awesome!

02:12.720 --> 02:15.990
You all did about as well.

02:17.260 --> 02:18.490
Hey!

02:18.490 --> 02:21.960
Some people from Class A 
just barged into Class B!

02:28.460 --> 02:31.010
What do you want, Sakayanagi-san?

02:32.280 --> 02:37.760
I've always had <i>such</i> respect 
for the teamwork of Class B.

02:37.760 --> 02:39.420
What are you getting at?

02:40.760 --> 02:43.950
I've come here to save you.

02:45.320 --> 02:47.270
Why don't you get to the point already?

02:47.650 --> 02:51.420
You've entrusted all your private 
points to Ichinose-san,

02:51.420 --> 02:55.580
and backed by that savings, 
you've overcome many hardships.

02:55.910 --> 02:57.660
It's in regard to that.

02:57.660 --> 02:59.780
What about it?

02:59.780 --> 03:03.270
There's nothing wrong with it, in and of itself.

03:05.460 --> 03:11.200
But what if it turns out that 
this accusation is true?

03:11.800 --> 03:15.420
What if Ichinose-san really is a criminal?

03:15.630 --> 03:17.030
It's nonsense.

03:17.030 --> 03:20.500
Just like the other rumors 
you've been spreading.

03:20.500 --> 03:23.560
I'm sure I have no idea 
what you're talking about.

03:23.930 --> 03:26.510
What I'm holding is solid proof

03:26.510 --> 03:30.690
that the rumors about Ichinose-san are true.

03:30.690 --> 03:32.440
She's got proof?

03:32.440 --> 03:33.940
What could it mean?

03:34.770 --> 03:36.700
Calm down, everyone!

03:36.940 --> 03:40.820
To entrust the entire class's 
points to someone like that...

03:40.820 --> 03:43.190
It just seems self-destructive, doesn't it?

03:44.270 --> 03:47.170
Is anything I'm saying false,

03:47.810 --> 03:49.680
Ichinose Honami-san?

03:53.220 --> 03:55.680
Could you please let me through?

03:55.680 --> 03:56.820
Ichinose?

03:57.230 --> 03:58.720
It'll be fine.

04:07.480 --> 04:09.540
I'm sorry, everyone.

04:12.980 --> 04:15.150
Be very quiet, everyone.

04:15.680 --> 04:18.490
She's attempting to show contrition.

04:21.590 --> 04:22.490
Everyone...

04:23.460 --> 04:27.310
Would you be willing to 
hear what I have to say?

04:28.770 --> 04:30.710
Sakayanagi-san is right.

04:31.390 --> 04:33.500
I have committed a crime.

04:34.880 --> 04:37.010
An unforgivable crime.

