04:42.010 --> 04:45.010
Four Years Ago

04:46.110 --> 04:51.450
I lived with just my mother 
and my little sister.

04:52.680 --> 04:54.900
It wasn't a life of luxury,

04:54.900 --> 04:56.290
but we had a lot of fun.

04:59.570 --> 05:05.910
Our mother worked very, 
very hard to provide for us.

05:08.040 --> 05:10.040
One Year Ago

05:13.820 --> 05:18.080
So I ran full tilt to earn scholarships 
to get into high school,

05:15.540 --> 05:17.050
<b>3rd-Year  Mock Exam  Extraordinary Scores</b>

05:15.540 --> 05:17.050
<b>1st  Ichinose Honami
 2nd  Tanaka Yusuke</b>

05:18.080 --> 05:21.280
even though I didn't have the money.

05:30.090 --> 05:30.880
But...

05:33.030 --> 05:35.320
In the summer of my third 
year of middle school...

05:42.450 --> 05:43.780
My mother...

05:44.850 --> 05:46.450
collapsed.

05:47.530 --> 05:49.040
<b>Emergency Exit</b>

05:49.040 --> 05:52.200
It turned out that, in trying to buy 
a birthday present for my sister,

05:52.540 --> 05:54.540
she took on more shifts 
than she could handle.

05:57.570 --> 06:00.600
My sister loved this one idol girl...

06:01.800 --> 06:04.740
And she had this one hair clip.

06:06.710 --> 06:12.030
My sister never talked about wanting 
fashionable clothing or games.

06:13.210 --> 06:17.750
It was the first thing 
she'd ever said she wanted.

06:23.960 --> 06:28.550
Mom apologized over and over again.

06:28.880 --> 06:32.740
"I'm sorry I couldn't give 
you a birthday present."

06:34.840 --> 06:36.500
So I made up my mind.

06:36.940 --> 06:42.450
I would buy that hair clip 
for my little sister.

06:47.080 --> 06:48.850
I knew it was coming,

06:48.850 --> 06:54.250
but obviously, no one was willing to 
hire a middle school student part-time.

06:54.970 --> 06:56.600
<b>Work Days</b>

06:54.970 --> 06:56.600
<b>Days Off</b>

06:54.970 --> 06:56.600
<b>Salary</b>

06:54.970 --> 06:56.600
<b>2-5 per week</b>

06:54.970 --> 06:56.600
<b>Days Off</b>

06:54.970 --> 06:56.600
<b>General 1,200 yen
 High School 1,080 yen
*Cannot hire middle school</b>

06:56.820 --> 07:00.980
Nevertheless, I did everything 
I could to earn money.

07:02.090 --> 07:03.010
Except...

07:07.610 --> 07:09.830
<b>Last Chance to Buy</b>

07:17.330 --> 07:19.690
Wow! Isn't it so cute?

07:19.690 --> 07:21.710
It's the one she wore in the magazine!

07:21.130 --> 07:22.500
Yeah! I've wanted it so much!

07:22.500 --> 07:25.090
I love it!

07:25.090 --> 07:26.500
Hey, let's come back tomorrow!

07:26.500 --> 07:29.610
Yeah! We can't afford it today, 
but if we come back tomorrow...

07:35.600 --> 07:37.850
<b>Last Chance to Buy</b>

07:38.900 --> 07:43.190
I wanted that hair clip so badly.

07:57.770 --> 07:59.910
Nobody saw me.

08:01.780 --> 08:07.560
I lied and said a friend lent me the money.

08:10.930 --> 08:13.850
My sister was so happy.

08:14.660 --> 08:18.260
She said, "Thanks, Big Sis!" so many times.

08:20.160 --> 08:26.370
The sight of my sister's smile 
temporarily alleviated my guilt.

08:28.790 --> 08:30.840
When my mother got out of the hospital,

08:31.670 --> 08:33.510
my sister and I went to see her.

08:35.000 --> 08:40.020
My sister was so proud as she 
showed our mother the hair clip.

08:41.140 --> 08:44.850
I couldn't bring myself to tell 
her to keep it a secret...

08:45.600 --> 08:47.800
She was just so happy about it!

08:54.140 --> 08:58.770
I think my mother knew I'd stolen it.

08:59.250 --> 09:01.240
I couldn't hide it.

09:04.110 --> 09:08.610
She quickly took me back to the 
store to make me apologize.

09:09.040 --> 09:13.880
I was finally coming to terms 
with exactly what I'd done.

09:16.280 --> 09:20.980
The minute we got home, my mother started 
crying, like a dam had burst inside her.

09:22.130 --> 09:27.060
I'd never seen my mother 
cry like that before.

09:29.760 --> 09:35.280
In the end, the people from the store 
didn't turn me in to the police.

09:36.890 --> 09:39.170
I completely withdrew.

09:39.570 --> 09:42.870
I spent six months rebuking myself.

09:43.890 --> 09:46.350
I didn't leave my room.

10:08.710 --> 10:10.010
But...

10:10.010 --> 10:12.480
My mother told me...

10:10.010 --> 10:15.260
Don't give up on high school.

10:15.480 --> 10:18.550
"Honami, don't give up on high school."

10:20.160 --> 10:23.910
"I want you to find your own happiness."

10:37.330 --> 10:42.230
So when I came here, 
I decided to try for a fresh start.

10:43.220 --> 10:48.100
To restore my mother's and 
sister's trust in me, too.

10:52.760 --> 10:54.050
Everyone...

10:54.660 --> 10:56.720
I'm so sorry I never told you.

10:57.990 --> 11:01.820
I'm sorry I've been such an awful leader.

11:02.570 --> 11:04.600
You're not, Ichinose!

11:05.810 --> 11:08.140
We understand what you were going through.

11:08.140 --> 11:13.610
You shared your secret with us 
now because you trust us, right?

11:15.410 --> 11:16.610
You guys...

11:18.060 --> 11:20.580
Are you trying to make me laugh?

11:21.030 --> 11:22.570
Sakayanagi-san...

11:23.030 --> 11:26.460
No matter the circumstances, 
shoplifting is shoplifting.

11:27.060 --> 11:29.480
There's nothing to feel sympathy for.

11:30.560 --> 11:32.840
Yes. You're right.

11:33.480 --> 11:37.470
The sins you've committed 
never fully go away.

11:37.470 --> 11:38.740
Ichinose...

11:39.220 --> 11:42.680
It's true. I shoplifted.

11:43.780 --> 11:45.910
I don't intend to run away from that.

11:46.680 --> 11:50.830
Because... I did do something wrong.

11:51.360 --> 11:54.480
Such a brazen lack of shame.

11:55.120 --> 11:55.970
You're right.

11:56.550 --> 12:00.380
Perhaps all my hard work came 
from a place of pretend virtue.

12:01.490 --> 12:06.400
But... I want to graduate with 
all of you. In this class!

12:07.010 --> 12:09.500
I want to walk alongside all of you!

12:10.170 --> 12:13.030
Despite all my failings, everyone...

12:13.400 --> 12:16.010
Will you come to the very end with me?

12:16.010 --> 12:17.260
Of course we will.

12:17.540 --> 12:19.510
We'll come along with her, right?

12:19.510 --> 12:20.570
You bet!

12:20.570 --> 12:20.910
Yeah!

12:20.910 --> 12:22.640
Of course!

12:26.140 --> 12:27.980
That's amazing.

12:28.600 --> 12:31.410
Sakayanagi. What now?

12:34.660 --> 12:36.150
Hey, come on!

12:36.150 --> 12:37.970
I see.

12:37.970 --> 12:40.160
Isn't this a happy little resolution?

12:40.970 --> 12:44.830
But the truth remains that 
you committed a crime.

12:45.240 --> 12:47.740
The story's going to continue to spread.

12:48.320 --> 12:49.920
I'm prepared for that.

12:49.920 --> 12:51.550
Are you?

12:51.940 --> 12:54.010
Then I'll do—

12:53.220 --> 12:56.290
Okay, that's enough.

12:56.290 --> 12:59.470
The student council president 
and the teachers?

12:59.860 --> 13:04.430
The spreading of malicious 
rumors is hereby forbidden.

13:04.690 --> 13:10.440
Did Ichinose-san report the 
trouble she was having?

13:10.440 --> 13:14.970
This problem has gone far 
beyond just Ichinose.

13:14.970 --> 13:17.080
We've been made aware of

13:17.080 --> 13:20.820
the hurtful comments being 
perpetuated among you first-years.

13:21.490 --> 13:25.600
Any further spreading of rumors would 
breach the school's code of morality.

13:26.580 --> 13:32.080
Any person found spreading malicious 
rumors will henceforth be punished.

13:33.990 --> 13:35.230
I see.

13:35.570 --> 13:39.640
If the school's gotten involved, 
then my business here is finished.

13:40.390 --> 13:42.090
I'll be taking my leave.

13:54.280 --> 13:57.760
Splendidly done, Ayanokoji-kun.

13:58.660 --> 14:00.630
Could you tell me one thing?

14:01.560 --> 14:07.240
Did Ichinose-san confess her 
past to you before today?

14:07.900 --> 14:08.680
Yes.

14:12.240 --> 14:15.920
I visited Ichinose's room yesterday.

14:19.080 --> 14:23.370
Hey... could I ask you a strange question?

14:24.310 --> 14:25.040
Sure.

14:25.510 --> 14:29.950
Why don't you say anything to me?

14:32.280 --> 14:34.680
The reason I come here every day

14:35.100 --> 14:38.140
is because I'm waiting for you to confess...

14:39.650 --> 14:40.660
I suppose.

14:42.190 --> 14:44.920
Waiting for me... to confess?

14:46.040 --> 14:50.610
I know what crime it is you're guilty of.

14:52.580 --> 14:53.620
Ichinose.

14:54.580 --> 14:57.570
What you did won't vanish 
because you ran from it.

14:57.570 --> 14:58.760
Stop it!

15:00.630 --> 15:03.900
I... I just...

15:04.250 --> 15:06.620
I know I did a bad thing.

15:07.450 --> 15:11.250
I really thought I didn't have a choice!

15:13.220 --> 15:16.600
I wanted to make my sister smile!

15:18.360 --> 15:19.780
I was so thoughtless.

15:20.270 --> 15:21.480
I was so stupid.

15:21.810 --> 15:23.810
Running was all I could do.

15:24.210 --> 15:25.620
And now, again...

15:29.750 --> 15:34.160
And now, just like then,

15:34.510 --> 15:36.270
I've completely withdrawn.

15:38.040 --> 15:40.370
What should I have done?

15:41.590 --> 15:43.250
What should I do now?

15:43.250 --> 15:44.590
Tell me.

15:45.410 --> 15:48.320
Tell me, Ayanokoji-kun!

15:49.480 --> 15:53.950
How am I supposed to leave this room?

15:53.950 --> 15:55.600
I don't know.

15:56.350 --> 15:58.640
I think you'll just have to face it yourself.

15:59.490 --> 16:00.550
Am I wrong?

16:07.890 --> 16:10.180
Ichinose's heart was broken.

16:12.330 --> 16:13.230
I'm...

16:20.070 --> 16:21.160
I'm the one

16:23.700 --> 16:25.170
who shattered it.

16:27.090 --> 16:31.560
Then the broken part healed 
back stronger than before,

16:31.560 --> 16:33.810
allowing her to rebuke your accusation.

16:34.650 --> 16:36.040
That's what happened.

16:36.460 --> 16:38.560
How very moving.

16:39.050 --> 16:42.350
You used Kamuro to bring 
me into this, didn't you?

16:42.350 --> 16:44.820
What makes you so sure?

16:45.380 --> 16:51.190
The can of beer she gave me is the one 
she stole early in the school year.

16:51.700 --> 16:54.640
The "best by" date on the can she gave me

16:54.640 --> 16:59.970
was almost a year before 
the ones currently on sale.

17:01.360 --> 17:06.610
Which means that beer came 
from you, Sakayanagi.

17:08.840 --> 17:13.000
I'd initially intended to simply 
wait and watch what happened.

17:13.530 --> 17:17.110
But you used Kamuro to drag me into it.

17:17.110 --> 17:18.220
Why?

17:18.450 --> 17:22.400
I did it all to get you interested in me.

17:22.770 --> 17:27.720
So you don't care about Ichinose at all?

17:28.440 --> 17:29.360
Correct.

17:31.080 --> 17:33.080
Why don't we have a competition?

17:33.700 --> 17:35.740
I don't see what I have to gain by agreeing.

17:35.740 --> 17:41.000
What if I put my own expulsion on the line?

17:41.990 --> 17:47.500
Obviously, even if I lose, 
you won't need to quit school yourself.

17:48.600 --> 17:49.760
However...

17:50.000 --> 17:55.250
If you lose, I will reveal to everyone 
that you're the mastermind behind Class C.

17:55.840 --> 17:58.010
What are we wagering on?

17:58.290 --> 18:00.610
How about the upcoming exam?

18:01.560 --> 18:06.650
It seems my school life is 
finally about to get exciting.

18:14.860 --> 18:17.410
Thank you for the chocolate you gave me.

18:18.640 --> 18:23.670
I didn't call you here to 
talk about that, silly.

18:24.360 --> 18:30.460
<i>The information Kushida gave me 
before Valentine's was on the money.</i>

18:31.860 --> 18:37.420
Vice President Kiriyama, I want you to post 
this information on the message boards.

18:37.770 --> 18:39.930
To save Ichinose.

18:40.230 --> 18:44.310
If this comes out, trust among 
the student body will plummet.

18:44.310 --> 18:49.300
The person who will be hurt the 
most by that is President Nagumo.

18:50.020 --> 18:52.690
Wouldn't that be to your benefit?

18:52.980 --> 18:55.680
And I'll be the one punished for it.

18:56.080 --> 18:58.490
If you refuse to do this,

18:59.410 --> 19:02.770
I'll have to report to the former president

19:03.130 --> 19:06.390
that you've already fallen 
in line with Nagumo.

19:07.200 --> 19:08.120
Very well.

19:08.640 --> 19:12.050
You owe me a big favor, though.

19:13.970 --> 19:15.450
I appreciate it.

19:15.450 --> 19:18.130
I'm just happy to be of service!

19:18.130 --> 19:20.180
So, you know what to do, right?

19:20.180 --> 19:20.980
Yeah.

19:21.470 --> 19:22.820
Points will be transferred.
 Accept?
 Cancel  Confirm

19:22.170 --> 19:24.480
I just sent you your informant's fee.

19:22.820 --> 19:24.480
Point Transfer in Progress

19:24.920 --> 19:26.340
Go on and check it.

19:28.900 --> 19:30.480
Looks great to me!

19:30.480 --> 19:34.990
From now on, I'll be giving you 
half of any points that I earn.

19:35.250 --> 19:36.520
Is that acceptable?

19:37.780 --> 19:38.600
Yep!

19:38.990 --> 19:43.790
As long as you keep paying me, 
I'll let bygones be bygones.

19:43.790 --> 19:45.960
You're so smart, Ayanokoji-kun.

19:45.960 --> 19:48.750
You're not at all like Horikita-san.

19:49.040 --> 19:51.560
Can we continue to get along?

19:52.550 --> 19:55.090
<i>Rising to Sakayanagi's challenge</i>

19:55.590 --> 19:59.260
<i>and saving Ichinose were purely incidental.</i>

19:59.920 --> 20:04.070
<i>There's only one thing I wanted 
to learn via this incident...</i>

20:05.130 --> 20:09.040
<i>The quality and quantity of the 
information Kushida Kikyo possesses.</i>

20:10.070 --> 20:11.680
<i>To confirm that,</i>

20:13.740 --> 20:15.590
<i>and to compel her expulsion.</i>

21:49.950 --> 21:51.760
Morning, Ayanokoji-kun!

21:52.100 --> 21:53.320
Morning.

21:53.320 --> 21:55.540
You were pretty cool yesterday.

21:58.160 --> 22:00.030
Y-You think so?

22:00.030 --> 22:03.480
It's impressive to put your old 
demons to rest with your own power.

22:04.540 --> 22:05.910
Yeah, I guess.

22:06.740 --> 22:09.380
I can't take back what I did back then.

22:09.800 --> 22:10.600
But...

22:11.140 --> 22:13.810
I think I can live with it from now on.

22:14.510 --> 22:18.600
If you ever run the risk of 
losing sight of yourself again,

22:19.220 --> 22:21.570
feel free to talk to me.

22:24.570 --> 22:28.460
I'm always capable of listening, at least.

22:30.430 --> 22:33.260
You'd let me rely on you like that?

22:33.600 --> 22:35.430
If you're willing to, at least.

22:38.120 --> 22:40.200
I... I see.

22:41.040 --> 22:42.820
Um, I...

22:44.120 --> 22:45.140
What is it?

22:45.690 --> 22:47.560
Well, see...

22:48.400 --> 22:50.980
Oh, th-that's funny...

22:50.980 --> 22:53.480
I thought it would come out more smoothly.

22:54.480 --> 22:56.110
What's wrong with me?

22:56.110 --> 22:59.840
I've never given anyone 
something like this before...

23:00.330 --> 23:03.000
But I'm not sure how else to 
show my appreciation, so...

23:03.000 --> 23:05.410
You don't have to force it.

23:05.410 --> 23:07.870
I-I-I-I'm not forcing it!

23:12.050 --> 23:15.870
It's a bit late... but here.

23:15.870 --> 23:17.240
Valentine's Day chocolate.

23:18.470 --> 23:20.690
Y-You don't want it?

23:23.010 --> 23:24.050
I do.

23:25.110 --> 23:26.000
Thank you.
